# UNI-14 (paideia-as#1601) — cargo-fuzz state is per-worker, per-run,
# and reaches gigabytes once a long-running fuzz worker has been
# running for a while. None of it belongs in version control: the
# corpus is regenerated by every fuzz run, the artifacts are the
# minimized reproducers for a crash the committer should instead
# commit as a dedicated regression test under
# `crates/paideia-as-unicode/tests/`, and `coverage/` is sanitizer
# instrumentation output.
corpus/
artifacts/
coverage/
target/
